WEBVTT

00:00.655 --> 00:03.655
[scary music]
[恐怖音乐]

00:03.655 --> 00:10.721
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:15.955 --> 00:19.788
- Listen up, crew.
I have an announcement!
- 听着，船员们。
我有一个公告！

00:19.788 --> 00:22.321
Bikini Bottom's
new sports stadium
比基尼泳裤
新体育场

00:22.321 --> 00:25.821
will officially be named
after this restaurant!
将被正式命名
在这家餐厅之后！

00:25.821 --> 00:28.955
- The Krusty Krab Stadium!
Wow!
- 蟹堡王体育场！
哇！

00:28.955 --> 00:31.888
- Soon I'll have all
the concessions in the stadium.
- 很快我就会拥有一切
体育场内的优惠。

00:31.888 --> 00:36.055
Paying for the naming rights
will make me millions!
支付冠名权费用
将使我赚到数百万！

00:36.055 --> 00:39.255
- Opening day is today!
Tailgate party!
- 今天是开幕日！
车尾派对！

00:39.255 --> 00:40.855
- Not for you.
- 不适合你。

00:40.855 --> 00:42.288
Your tails
have to stay here
你的尾巴
必须留在这里

00:42.288 --> 00:44.888
and make me back
some of that money I spent.
让我回来
我花掉了其中一些钱。

00:44.888 --> 00:47.321
- Hooray for Mr. Krabs!
- 蟹老板万岁！

00:47.321 --> 00:50.655
- While I'm gone,
Squidward mans the helm.
- 当我不在的时候，
章鱼哥掌舵。

00:52.221 --> 00:53.655
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

00:53.655 --> 00:56.055
- Psst.
Hey, Squidward.
- 嘘。
嘿，章鱼哥。

00:56.055 --> 01:00.055
- Oh, Teddy, you're
my favorite snuggle buddy.
- 哦，泰迪，你是
我最喜欢的依偎伙伴。

01:01.355 --> 01:02.655
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:02.655 --> 01:04.288
- Okay, boss, give me
a job to do, please.
- 好的，老板，给我
有工作要做，拜托。

01:04.288 --> 01:07.021
- Well, why don't you clean
the, uh--
- 好吧，你为什么不干净呢？
的，呃——

01:08.888 --> 01:11.288
Well, you could always
clean the, uh--
好吧，你总是可以
清理，呃——

01:12.821 --> 01:14.655
Why don't you clean
your own--
你为什么不干净
你自己的——

01:14.655 --> 01:16.021
Oh.
哦。

01:16.021 --> 01:18.655
All right, all right, um...
好吧好吧，嗯……

01:18.655 --> 01:20.221
clean everything
one more time.
清洁一切
再过一次。

01:20.221 --> 01:21.221
- On it!
- 就它了！

01:23.088 --> 01:24.388
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

01:24.388 --> 01:25.521
- Done.
More, please.
- 完毕。
请更多。

01:25.521 --> 01:27.321
- Two more times.
- 再过两次。

01:27.321 --> 01:28.788
- Done, done.
- 完成了，完成了。

01:28.788 --> 01:31.988
- Ah, but did you clean down
to the subatomic particles?
- 啊，但是你清理干净了吗？
到亚原子粒子？

01:31.988 --> 01:33.988
- [grunts]
I knew I missed something.
- [咕哝]
我知道我错过了一些东西。

01:35.088 --> 01:36.821
- Done.
Even the theoretical particles
- 完毕。
即使是理论粒子

01:36.821 --> 01:38.521
are clean, theoretically.
理论上是干净的。

01:38.521 --> 01:40.855
[laughs]
- Um, I don't know.
[笑]
- 嗯，我不知道。

01:40.855 --> 01:42.355
Why don't you just--
I don't know--
你为什么不只是——
我不知道——

01:42.355 --> 01:44.855
see how many things
you can flush down the toilet?
看看有多少东西
你可以冲马桶吗？

01:44.855 --> 01:48.055
- Um, are you sure
about that, boss?
- 嗯，你确定吗
老板，关于这个？

01:48.055 --> 01:50.088
- Are you questioning
my orders?
- 你在质疑吗
我的命令？

01:50.088 --> 01:52.288
- I hear and obey,
my liege.
- 我听到并服从，
我的君主。

01:52.288 --> 01:55.355
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:56.421 --> 01:57.655
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

01:57.655 --> 02:00.055
[screams]
What have I done?
[尖叫声]
我做了什么？

02:00.055 --> 02:01.688
- How am I doing, boss?
- 我怎么样，老板？

02:02.955 --> 02:07.088
- This is a completely
irresponsible thing to do!
- 这完全是一个
做不负责任的事！

02:08.521 --> 02:11.255
But I must admit,
it looks amazing.
但我必须承认，
看起来棒极了。

02:11.255 --> 02:12.388
- How about this?
- 这个怎么样？

02:12.388 --> 02:13.455
- Here, try this!
- 来，试试这个！

02:13.455 --> 02:15.388
- [laughing]
- [笑]

02:15.388 --> 02:16.721
- Here you go!
- 干得好！

02:16.721 --> 02:18.155
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

02:19.755 --> 02:22.221
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

02:22.221 --> 02:24.655
- This'll go down good.
[grunts]
- 这会进展顺利。
[咕哝]

02:24.655 --> 02:26.088
Oops.
哎呀。

02:27.221 --> 02:28.155
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:29.388 --> 02:31.388
[grunting and laughing]
[咕哝和大笑]

02:34.188 --> 02:36.855
- That was funny. It almost
looked like Mr. Krabs' safe--
- 这很有趣。差不多了
看起来就像蟹老板的保险箱——

02:36.855 --> 02:38.121
you know, the one
你知道，那个

02:38.121 --> 02:40.255
with the secret
Krabby Patty formula inside?
与秘密
里面有蟹黄饼配方吗？

02:40.255 --> 02:41.921
- [laughs]
What's really funny is that
- [笑]
真正有趣的是

02:41.921 --> 02:43.821
it was Mr. Krabs' safe,
the one with the--
这是蟹老板的保险箱，
那个有——

02:43.821 --> 02:46.288
both: Secret Krabby Patty
formula inside!
两者：秘密蟹黄帕蒂
里面有公式！

02:48.788 --> 02:49.888
- How could you?
- 你怎么可以？

02:49.888 --> 02:51.188
- You ordered me to!
- 你命令我这么做的！

02:51.188 --> 02:52.388
- I didn't say the safe!
- 我没说保险箱！

02:52.388 --> 02:53.955
- You didn't say
not the safe.
-你没说
不是保险箱。

02:53.955 --> 02:56.421
- Well, I order you
to go get it!
- 好吧，我命令你
去拿吧！

02:56.421 --> 02:58.055
- One second.
- 一秒钟。

02:58.055 --> 03:00.655
Employees must wash hands
before leaving.
员工必须洗手
离开之前。

03:00.655 --> 03:03.655
[adventurous music]
[冒险音乐]

03:03.655 --> 03:05.455
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:05.455 --> 03:06.655
- What have I done?
- 我做了什么？

03:06.655 --> 03:08.755
I flushed SpongeBob
down the toilet.
我把海绵宝宝冲红了
下厕所。

03:08.755 --> 03:11.221
Why, that's despicable,
even for me.
为什么，这太卑鄙了
即使对我来说也是如此。

03:11.221 --> 03:12.688
[all murmuring]
- All right,
[大家窃窃私语]
- 好吧，

03:12.688 --> 03:14.788
as soon as I get the fry cook
out of the toilet,
我一拿到炒菜厨师
从厕所出来，

03:14.788 --> 03:17.355
you can all have
your Krabby Patties.
你们都可以拥有
你的蟹黄饼。

03:17.355 --> 03:19.955
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

03:22.655 --> 03:23.788
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:23.788 --> 03:25.455
Yuck.
恶心。

03:25.455 --> 03:28.355
It's so unsanitary.
太不卫生了

03:28.355 --> 03:31.488
I can't believe
I'm doing this.
我不敢相信
我正在做这个。

03:33.855 --> 03:37.521
[marching band music]
[行进乐队音乐]

03:37.521 --> 03:40.021
- Ow!
- Krabs, you old bag of shells.
- 噢！
- 螃蟹，你这个老贝壳袋。

03:40.021 --> 03:41.721
You're not gonna regret
paying that money
你不会后悔的
付那笔钱

03:41.721 --> 03:43.988
to have your name
on this stadium I built for you.
有你的名字
在我为你建造的这个体育场上。

03:43.988 --> 03:45.255
- I sure hope
you're right.
- 我当然希望
你是对的。

03:45.255 --> 03:46.821
- Oh!
- Oh, Krabs, I'd like you
- 哦！
- 哦，蟹蟹，我想要你

03:46.821 --> 03:49.455
to meet Charlton Hawkfish,
the famous sewer architect.
去见查尔顿鹰鱼，
著名的下水道建筑师。

03:49.455 --> 03:53.421
- I designed every pipe,
gasket, and cesspit
- 我设计了每根管道，
垫圈和污水坑

03:53.421 --> 03:55.055
beneath this stadium.
在这个体育场的下面。

03:55.055 --> 03:57.655
- [chuckles]
Eh, hi.
- [轻笑]
呃，嗨。

03:57.655 --> 04:01.188
- That was weird.
I had to flush the toilet twice.
- 这很奇怪。
我不得不冲厕所两次。

04:01.188 --> 04:04.255
- And they call this is place
a modern marvel.
- 他们称这就是地方
现代奇迹。

04:04.255 --> 04:07.455
- Crupski, you told me
you wouldn't cut corners
- 克鲁普斯基，你告诉我的
你不会偷工减料

04:07.455 --> 04:08.788
on my plans!
按照我的计划！

04:08.788 --> 04:10.988
What's this?
Ah!
这是什么？
啊!

04:10.988 --> 04:14.555
You've added a reducer
into a 5-foot main line!
您添加了一个减速器
进入5英尺的主线！

04:14.555 --> 04:16.055
- Your point being?
- 你的意思是？

04:16.055 --> 04:19.655
- That pipe's too small!
It'll never hold.
- 那个管子太小了！
它永远不会持有。

04:19.655 --> 04:20.988
- Relax, Charlton.
- 放松，查尔顿。

04:20.988 --> 04:23.655
Building it cheap
saved a lot of money.
建造成本低廉
节省了很多钱。

04:23.655 --> 04:25.655
- Ooh!
I like that.
- 哦！
我喜欢这样。

04:25.655 --> 04:26.688
- And what's this?
- 这是什么？

04:26.688 --> 04:29.121
The pipe is made
out of cardboard?
管道已制成
用纸板？

04:29.121 --> 04:31.288
- Eh, corrugated cardboard.
- 呃，瓦楞纸板。

04:31.288 --> 04:32.688
- Ah, relax.
- 啊，放松点。

04:32.688 --> 04:35.421
That's what my grandma's
dentures are made of.
这就是我奶奶的
假牙是由.

04:35.421 --> 04:39.021
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

04:42.355 --> 04:45.288
SpongeBob,
are you down here?
海绵宝宝，
你在下面吗？

04:49.355 --> 04:50.155
Yi!
呀！

04:50.155 --> 04:51.655
- Hiya, Squidward.
- 你好，章鱼哥。

04:51.655 --> 04:52.921
- Eeh!
Do not touch me!
- 呃！
不要碰我！

04:52.921 --> 04:56.155
I am way out
of my comfort zone.
我已经出路了
我的舒适区。

04:57.655 --> 04:59.955
All right, you've been
down here longer than me.
好吧，你已经
在这里比我还长。

04:59.955 --> 05:02.188
Which way?
哪条路？

05:02.188 --> 05:03.555
- Pull my finger.
- 拉我的手指。

05:05.455 --> 05:06.455
That way.
那样。

05:06.455 --> 05:08.055
- Figures.
- 数字。

05:08.055 --> 05:11.455
- * Sewer, sewer, cha cha cha,
sewer, sewer, cha cha cha *
- *下水道，下水道，恰恰，
下水道、下水道、恰恰*

05:11.455 --> 05:14.655
* Sewer, sewer,
cha cha cha *
* 下水道，下水道，
恰恰恰恰 *

05:14.655 --> 05:17.488
Look at these strange etchings,
Squidward.
看看这些奇怪的蚀刻，
章鱼哥。

05:17.488 --> 05:19.021
- Look like snakes.
- 看起来像蛇。

05:19.021 --> 05:21.655
- I hope we don't run into
anything like that down here.
- 我希望我们不会遇到
这里有类似的东西。

05:23.788 --> 05:25.388
Hey!
Over there!
嘿！
在那边！

05:26.721 --> 05:27.955
It's stuck on the pipe!
卡在水管上了！

05:27.955 --> 05:29.921
- We need to get
up there!
- 我们需要得到
上面！

05:29.921 --> 05:32.321
[grunting]
Ow! Huh?
[咕噜声]
噢！啊？

05:35.655 --> 05:37.721
- * Sewer, sewer,
cha cha cha *
- * 下水道，下水道，
恰恰恰恰 *

05:37.721 --> 05:39.055
- There it is!
[grunts]
- 就是这样！
[咕哝]

05:39.055 --> 05:40.488
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:40.488 --> 05:44.088
- [grunts] Ah!
Darn it, I missed again.
- [咕哝]啊！
可恶，我又错过了。

05:44.088 --> 05:46.988
[screams]
Leapin' lampreys!
[尖叫声]
跳跃的七鳃鳗！

05:46.988 --> 05:48.555
They're biting me!
他们在咬我！

05:48.555 --> 05:49.655
- Well, bite 'em back!
- 好吧，咬回去！

05:51.155 --> 05:53.455
- [screaming]
My eyes!
- [尖叫]
我的眼睛！

05:53.455 --> 05:55.021
[screaming]
[尖叫]

05:55.021 --> 05:56.988
- Hey, look,
there's the safe!
- 嘿，看，
那里有保险箱！

05:56.988 --> 05:58.355
- Where?
Where?
- 在哪里？
在哪里？

06:00.721 --> 06:01.921
- There it is.
- 就在那里。

06:01.921 --> 06:03.988
* O sole mio *
*我的太阳神*

06:03.988 --> 06:05.655
- Silencio.
- 沉默。

06:05.655 --> 06:08.388
- Yay!
Whoo-hoo!
- 耶！
呼呼！

06:10.655 --> 06:12.388
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:14.521 --> 06:18.655
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:23.788 --> 06:27.155
- What the--
[snake roars]
- 什么是--
[蛇吼]

06:27.155 --> 06:28.755
both:
Sewer snake!
两者：
下水道蛇！

06:28.755 --> 06:30.821
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:30.821 --> 06:32.521
[marching band music]
[行进乐队音乐]

06:32.521 --> 06:35.121
- It's five minutes
to halftime.
- 五分钟了
到中场休息。

06:35.121 --> 06:37.788
Do you know
what that means?
你知道吗
这意味着什么？

06:37.788 --> 06:39.921
- [chuckles]
Sure do,
- [轻笑]
当然可以，

06:39.921 --> 06:42.221
the Bikini Bottom-ettes!
比基尼内裤！

06:42.221 --> 06:44.988
- The halftime wave, man!
- 中场休息，伙计！

06:44.988 --> 06:48.221
When every toilet
flushes at once!
每次上厕所的时候
立刻就红了！

06:48.221 --> 06:50.188
The sewers
can't take it!
下水道
受不了！

06:50.188 --> 06:52.521
It's madness!
这太疯狂了！

06:52.521 --> 06:55.955
- Okay, but you're gonna miss
the cheerleaders!
- 好吧，但你会想念的
啦啦队们！

06:55.955 --> 06:59.088
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

07:00.488 --> 07:01.988
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

07:01.988 --> 07:03.655
- In here!
- 在这里！

07:06.388 --> 07:08.821
- Ooh, Look!
"You are here."
- 哦，看！
“你在这里。”

07:08.821 --> 07:11.655
- Why is the diagram shaped
like a giant sewer snake
- 为什么图表是这样的形状
像一条巨大的下水道蛇

07:11.655 --> 07:14.688
with the arrow pointing
to its stomach?
与箭头指向
到它的胃里？

07:14.688 --> 07:16.088
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

07:16.088 --> 07:18.288
- Oh, crossing "Digested
by a giant sewer snake"
- 哦，穿越“消化了
被一条巨大的下水道蛇“

07:18.288 --> 07:20.388
off of my to-do list.
从我的待办事项清单中删除。

07:20.388 --> 07:21.921
- Oh, that makes sense.
- 哦，这是有道理的。

07:21.921 --> 07:25.321
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:25.321 --> 07:27.721
Snake food!
[screaming]
蛇食！
[尖叫]

07:31.321 --> 07:33.288
- Good going, Squidward.
You're tickling him.
- 干得好，章鱼哥。
你在挠他痒痒。

07:33.288 --> 07:34.555
I'll help you!
我来帮助你！

07:34.555 --> 07:37.488
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

07:39.088 --> 07:41.721
Squidward, the safe!
Squidward? Safe!
章鱼哥，保险箱！
章鱼哥？安全的！

07:41.721 --> 07:44.455
- [screaming] Don't bother me
while I'm hysterical!
- [尖叫]别打扰我
当我歇斯底里的时候！

07:44.455 --> 07:45.855
Aah!
啊啊！

07:45.855 --> 07:48.788
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:52.255 --> 07:54.788
- Oh!
- [grunts]
- 哦！
- [咕哝]

07:54.788 --> 07:56.188
- Oh.
- Ah!
- 哦。
- 啊！

07:56.188 --> 07:58.455
I'm alive?
I'm alive!
我还活着吗？
我还活着！

07:58.455 --> 08:00.455
- I guess
we're just lucky.
- 我猜
我们只是幸运。

08:00.455 --> 08:01.888
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:01.888 --> 08:03.655
- Oh, look,
you found the safe.
- 哦，看，
你找到了保险箱。

08:03.655 --> 08:05.321
- Just my luck.
- 只是我的运气。

08:05.321 --> 08:07.555
[intense music]
[激烈的音乐]

08:07.555 --> 08:09.188
[buzzer sounds, all cheering]
[蜂鸣器响起，全场欢呼]

08:09.188 --> 08:10.255
- Got to go!
- Oh, boy!
- 得走了！
- 哦，孩子！

08:10.255 --> 08:12.055
all:
Oh! Oh!
全部：
哦！哦！

08:12.055 --> 08:13.655
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

08:13.655 --> 08:15.388
Egads!
哎呀！

08:17.188 --> 08:19.855
Too much flushing,
she's gonna blow!
冲水过多，
她要爆炸了！

08:19.855 --> 08:21.455
[panting]
[alarm blaring]
[气喘吁吁]
[警报声]

08:21.455 --> 08:23.021
How's she holding up?
她还坚持得怎么样？

08:23.021 --> 08:26.221
- Sir, every tunnel is flooded
except for the reducer pipe.
- 先生，每条隧道都被淹没了
除异径管外。

08:26.221 --> 08:28.155
- The pinch point!
- 关键点！

08:28.155 --> 08:30.221
- Hmm.
Is that bad?
- 唔。
那很糟糕吗？

08:32.955 --> 08:34.088
both:
Huh?
两者：
啊？

08:35.388 --> 08:37.321
[both whimpering]
[两人都呜咽]

08:37.321 --> 08:40.388
- Gaskets blown,
manifold mangled,
- 垫圈被吹坏，
歧管损坏，

08:40.388 --> 08:42.188
backflow everywhere!
到处回流！

08:42.188 --> 08:43.721
- Oh, you're overreacting.
-哦，你反应过度了。

08:43.721 --> 08:46.955
- You flushed it all away,
Crupski!
- 你把一切都冲走了，
克鲁普斯基！

08:46.955 --> 08:48.421
You two better hope
你们两个最好希望

08:48.421 --> 08:52.388
that fail-safe
I installed works.
那个自动防故障装置
我安装了作品。

08:55.988 --> 08:59.121
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:00.221 --> 09:03.821
- Hot dogs, popcorn.
- 热狗，爆米花。

09:03.821 --> 09:05.655
Snorkles?
通气管？

09:05.655 --> 09:07.421
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:07.421 --> 09:10.721
- Good thing today was
Free Ax Day at the stadium.
- 今天的好事是
体育场免费斧头日。

09:12.621 --> 09:13.855
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:13.855 --> 09:16.655
[growls]
[咆哮]

09:21.655 --> 09:22.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:27.855 --> 09:30.788
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:36.921 --> 09:38.321
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

09:38.321 --> 09:41.488
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:41.488 --> 09:45.688
This is what you get
when so-called fishkind,
这就是你得到的
当所谓的鱼种时，

09:45.688 --> 09:49.821
in all its hubris and ignorance,
stoops so low
在其所有的傲慢和无知中，
弯得这么低

09:49.821 --> 09:53.521
as to cut corners
in its plumbing system.
至于偷工减料
在其管道系统中。

09:53.521 --> 09:58.321
Extinction is the result
of being cheap!
灭绝就是结果
便宜！

09:58.321 --> 10:00.521
- What a bunch of malarkey.
- 真是一群胡言乱语。

10:00.521 --> 10:04.455
- At least we didn't waken
the Great Sewer Snake.
- 至少我们没有醒来
下水道大蛇。

10:06.288 --> 10:07.688
Check that.
检查一下。

10:07.688 --> 10:09.655
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:09.655 --> 10:12.655
[snake roars]
[蛇吼]

10:14.988 --> 10:16.188
Ah!
啊!

10:16.188 --> 10:18.555
[snake roars]
Ah!
[蛇吼]
啊！

10:21.188 --> 10:22.355
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

10:23.655 --> 10:28.255
Whoa! Ooh! Whoo-hoo!
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哦！呼呼！
哇！哇！哇！

10:35.255 --> 10:36.721
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

10:39.388 --> 10:42.855
- Hey, everybody,
the cook's back from toilet.
- 嘿，大家，
厨师从厕所回来了。

10:42.855 --> 10:45.121
- Who's hungry?
- 谁饿了？

10:45.121 --> 10:48.255
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

[所有人尖叫]